    "purpose": "Defines lazy-loadable capability 'packs' and the exact measured files that ship in each. Sizes are computed from data/measurements.json by tools/build-register.mjs (gzip -9 per file, summed). Use these as the pack manifest seed.",
    "note": "A pack's gz sum approximates both network cost and APK cost (APK entries are deflate-compressed). Real bundles will differ ±15% (tree-shaking, code splitting)."
